  "ingredients": [
    "1 (16 ounce) package dry penne pasta",
    "0.5 cup olive oil",
    "1 medium head garlic, peeled and chopped",
    "2 tablespoons chopped fresh parsley",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh basil",
    "1 tablespoon chopped fresh oregano",
    "1 tablespoon red pepper flakes",
    "1 cup grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/V8zmhmx8RX2xIYGw1nyQS0B2ziQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-21339-garlic-pasta-ddmfs-step1-3x4-13667-9c617229377e4cabb3e3edd4bc9bd811.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21339/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Add penne and cook, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, 8 to 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ovQnzbH63B3WljsmI8ocEPBy6fY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-21339-garlic-pasta-ddmfs-step2-3x4-13691-13e6c3555e6e4313ac09ba7be09fcfe4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21339/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "While the pasta is cooking, add oil and garlic to a large skillet over low heat. Cook until oil is hot and garlic is sizzling, 8 to 12 minutes. Remove from the heat and stir in parsley, basil, oregano, and pepper flakes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/H4PJU3KAF-Qd-7yj7BDD017_2wo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-21339-garlic-pasta-ddmfs-step4-3x4-13688-0bc8ee1497974d6095ddb558443d10b4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21339/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain pasta and transfer to a large bowl. Add oil and garlic mixture, toss to coat, and let sit for 3 to 5 minutes. Sprinkle with Parmesan and serve.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uMsObUlozLT-RyHLYijxQwo2TB4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/RM-21339-garlic-pasta-ddmfs-step6-3x4-13701-2daeb9b5533949dcb66034d402bb508f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/21339/step_04.webp"
    }
  ],
